# 📄 Local config template — COPY this file to ".env" then fill in your key.
# (Template konfigurasi lokal — SALIN file ini menjadi ".env" lalu isi key Anda.)
#
# Easiest way: run `miniyt` (or run.bat) -> Settings [6] -> paste your key.
# (Cara termudah: jalankan `miniyt` / run.bat -> Pengaturan [6] -> paste key.)
#
#   1. Open https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (sign in with Google)
#      (Buka https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — login akun Google)
#   2. Click "Create API key" -> copy it
#      (Klik "Create API key" -> salin key-nya)
#   3. Fill in below (multiple keys allowed, comma-separated)
#      (Isi di bawah — boleh lebih dari satu key, dipisah koma)
#
# ⚠️ NEVER commit ".env" to git — it is git-ignored automatically.
#    (JANGAN commit ".env" ke git — sudah otomatis diabaikan .gitignore.)
#    Keys stay local, never uploaded anywhere. (Key lokal saja, tidak di-upload.)

# Gemini API Key (free tier) — optional, only needed for the per-surah cut
# feature. Without a key, all normal download features work as usual.
# (Gemini API Key (free tier) — opsional, hanya untuk fitur potong per surah.
#  Tanpa key, semua fitur unduh biasa tetap normal.)
GEMINI_API_KEYS=
